# Enforcement registered after versioning replaces the composed interceptor
# instead of re-composing with it, so the stamping stage is lost (#5241).
MODULE: StampedWhenVersionedReversedReplaces
TARGET: StampedWhenVersioned
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the reversed registration order resolves the enforcement stage alone

--- FIND
      [] r = "Reversed" -> <<"E", "V">>
--- REPLACE
      [] r = "Reversed" -> <<"E">>
--- END
